1
00:00:00,178 --> 00:00:02,348
It's not gonna explode. Just keep driving.

2
00:00:02,514 --> 00:00:05,474
(Penny:)Warp speed ahead, Mr. Spock.

3
00:00:06,977 --> 00:00:09,977
(Sheldon:)Mr. Spock did not pilot the Enterprise.

4
00:00:10,147 --> 00:00:11,477
(Sheldon:)He was the science officer.

5
00:00:11,648 --> 00:00:15,318
I guarantee that if he saw the Enterprise's
"check engine" light blinking...

6
00:00:15,485 --> 00:00:18,075
(Sheldon:)...he would
pull the ship over immediately.

7
00:00:18,822 --> 00:00:21,532
(Penny:)Oh, God, I'm gonna lose the arm.

8
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:24,660
Oop. Red light. Release accelerator...

9
00:00:24,828 --> 00:00:29,828
(Sheldon:)...and slowly apply the brake.

10
00:00:30,125 --> 00:00:31,875
[SHELDON SIGHING]

11
00:00:32,043 --> 00:00:33,713
(Sheldon:)Nailed it.

12
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:38,130
(Sheldon:)While we have a moment...

13
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:40,590
(Sheldon:)-...may I ask you a question?
-What?

14
00:00:40,761 --> 00:00:43,341
(Sheldon:)Why do you have
the Chinese character for "soup"...

15
00:00:43,513 --> 00:00:45,603
(Sheldon:)...tattooed on your right buttock?

16
00:00:45,974 --> 00:00:50,064
-It's not "soup." It's "courage."
-No, it isn't.

17
00:00:50,812 --> 00:00:52,442
(Sheldon:)I suppose it does take courage...

18
00:00:52,606 --> 00:00:55,646
(Sheldon:)...to demonstrate
that kind of commitment to soup.

19
00:00:57,235 --> 00:00:59,575
(Penny:)How did you see it?
You said you wouldn't look.

